# Normalize line endings so a Windows checkout does not turn every text file
# into CRLF. Several gates compare file bytes or digests (the `.kgl` golden
# hash, the benchmark-report contract, the docs-facts renderer), and a
# whole-file CRLF translation breaks them while showing as a whole-file diff.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary fixtures must never be line-ending-converted or diffed as text.
# Git's auto-detection only sniffs the first 8000 bytes for a NUL, so the
# `.kgl` fixtures currently pass by luck rather than by rule — a future save
# whose first 8 KB happen to be NUL-free would be silently corrupted on a
# Windows checkout.
*.kgl binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.gz binary
*.bz2 binary
*.zst binary
*.whl binary
